# Route: guide 30 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 48 to 50, 11
# quests, 2.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Badlands, Azshara): Hammertoe's Digsite -> Dustwind Gulch ->
# Hammertoe's Digsite -> Lethlor Ravine -> Hammertoe's Digsite -> Camp Cagg ->
# Dustwind Gulch -> Camp Cagg -> Valormok -> Shadowsong Shrine -> Haldarr
# Encampment -> Shadowsong Shrine -> Legashi Encampment -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Tremors of the Earth (717;
# Blacklash 50, Hematus 50).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5141
# Dragonscale Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862).

